OL,3,GNEWSADecision to delay council tax
OL,4,Ashake-up in Wales is 'absurd', says IFS
OL,5,
OL,6,FWales' finance minister has announced
OL,7,Fthe Welsh government wants to delay a
OL,8,Frevaluation of homes for council tax to
OL,9,F2032.
OL,11,FElin Jones said the decision was made
OL,12,Fbecause she could not afford the kind
OL,13,Fof financial relief she would want to
OL,14,Fput in place if she went ahead with a
OL,15,Fplanned revaluation in two years' time.
OL,17,FBut the Institute for Fiscal Studies
OL,18,F(IFS) think tank said the explanation
OL,19,Fgiven by Jones was "nonsensical" and
OL,20,F"absurd".
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
