OL,3,GNEWSADecision to delay council tax
OL,4,Ashake-up in Wales is 'absurd', says IFS
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt would mean that the values used to
OL,7,Fdecide how much households pay will
OL,8,Fremain based on house prices from 23
OL,9,Fyears ago.
